{{nihongo|'''''Harvest Moon GB'''''|牧場物語GB|Bokujō Monogatari GB}} is the second game in the ''[[Story of Seasons]]'' series of [[video game]]s, and was developed and published by [[Victor Interactive Software]]. ''Harvest Moon GB'' is the first portable ''Harvest Moon'' game, developed for the [[Game Boy]]. A [[Game Boy Color]] version was released later under the name '''''Harvest Moon GBC'''''. The Game Boy Color version was later released on the [[Virtual Console|3DS Virtual Console]] in 2013.

